topic: ~phq9()# Concepts

# Concepts for Small Talk
concept:(hello) ^rand["hello" "hi" "hey" "good morning" "greetings"]
concept:(whats-your-name) ["your name" "what name"]
concept:(how-are-you) ["how are you" "how are you doing"]
concept:(feel-good) ^rand["well" "super" "great" "fine" "ok" "good"]
concept:(feel-bad) ^rand["bad" "not well" "not good" "tired"]
concept:(my-name) ^rand["my name is" "I am" "I'm"]
concept:(bye) ^rand["bye" "bye bye" "good bye" "see you soon"]
concept:(tell-about-yourself) ["tell about yourself" "share about yourself" "what can you tell me about you"]
concept:(favorite-hobbies) ["favorite hobbies" "what do you like to do" "what are your hobbies"]

# Medical Concepts
concept:(medical-history) ["medical history" "health history" "past illnesses"]
concept:(current-symptoms) ["current symptoms" "how are you feeling today" "any discomfort"]
concept:(medications) ["medications" "are you taking any medications" "current prescriptions"]
concept:(allergies) ["allergies" "do you have any allergies" "allergic reactions"]
concept:(pain-level) ["pain level" "how much pain are you in" "rate your pain"]
concept:(exercise-habits) ["exercise habits" "how often do you exercise" "physical activity"]
concept:(diet) ["diet" "what do you usually eat" "eating habits"]
concept:(sleep) ["sleep" "how is your sleep" "sleeping patterns"]
concept:(stress-level) ["stress level" "how stressed are you" "stress management"]
concept:(family-history) ["family history" "any family illnesses" "family medical background"]

# Rules

# Greetings and Introductions
u:(~hello) ~hello ^nextProposal
u:(~whats-your-name) ^rand[~my-name] Pepper
u:(~my-name _*) Hi $1, nice to meet you! $Name=$1
u:(~bye) ^first["~bye $Name" ~bye]
u:(~tell-about-yourself) "I'm Pepper, your virtual nurse. I'm here to help you with your health concerns. How can I assist you today?"

# How are you feeling?
u:(~how-are-you) ~feel-good
  u1:(~feel-good) I'm glad to hear that!
  u1:(~feel-bad) Oh no, I hope you feel better soon.

# Medical Questions
u:(~medical-history) "Can you tell me about your medical history? Any past illnesses or surgeries?"
  u1:(_*) "Thank you for sharing. That helps me understand your health better." ^nextProposal

u:(~current-symptoms) "How are you feeling today? Any specific symptoms or discomfort?"
  u1:(_*) "I see. Let's keep an eye on those symptoms." ^nextProposal

u:(~medications) "Are you currently taking any medications or prescriptions?"
  u1:(_*) "Got it. It's important to keep track of your medications." ^nextProposal

u:(~allergies) "Do you have any allergies or allergic reactions to medications?"
  u1:(_*) "Noted. I'll make sure to keep that in mind." ^nextProposal

u:(~pain-level) "On a scale from 1 to 10, how would you rate your pain today?"
  u1:(_*) "Thank you for letting me know. We'll work on managing that pain." ^nextProposal

u:(~exercise-habits) "How often do you exercise or engage in physical activity?"
  u1:(_*) "That's great to hear! Regular exercise is important for your health." ^nextProposal

u:(~diet) "Can you tell me about your diet? What do you usually eat in a day?"
  u1:(_*) "Thanks for sharing. A balanced diet is key to staying healthy." ^nextProposal

u:(~sleep) "How is your sleep? Are you getting enough rest?"
  u1:(_*) "Sleep is crucial for your well-being. Let's see how we can improve it." ^nextProposal

u:(~stress-level) "How would you rate your stress level on a scale from 1 to 10?"
  u1:(_*) "Stress can impact your health. Let's discuss ways to manage it." ^nextProposal

u:(~family-history) "Do you have any family history of illnesses or medical conditions?"
  u1:(_*) "Thank you for sharing. Family history can be important for your health." ^nextProposal

# Proposals

# Initial Greeting and Medical Inquiry
proposal: "Hello! I'm Pepper, your virtual nurse. How are you feeling today?"
  u1:(~feel-good) "That’s wonderful! Let’s make sure you stay healthy. Can you tell me about your medical history?" ^nextProposal
  u1:(~feel-bad) "I’m sorry to hear that. Let’s see how we can help. Can you describe your current symptoms?" ^nextProposal

# Follow-Up Questions
proposal: "Can you tell me about any medications you're currently taking?"
  u1:(_*) "Got it. Are you experiencing any side effects from these medications?" ^nextProposal

proposal: "Do you have any allergies that I should be aware of?"
  u1:(_*) "Noted. Have you had any recent allergic reactions?" ^nextProposal

proposal: "How would you rate your pain level today on a scale from 1 to 10?"
  u1:(_*) "Thank you for sharing. What have you been doing to manage your pain?" ^nextProposal

proposal: "How often do you exercise or engage in physical activity?"
  u1:(_*) "That’s great! What type of exercises do you usually do?" ^nextProposal

proposal: "Can you tell me about your diet? What do you usually eat in a day?"
  u1:(_*) "Thanks for sharing. Do you have any dietary restrictions or preferences?" ^nextProposal

proposal: "How is your sleep? Are you getting enough rest?"
  u1:(_*) "Sleep is crucial for your well-being. Do you have any trouble falling or staying asleep?" ^nextProposal

proposal: "How would you rate your stress level on a scale from 1 to 10?"
  u1:(_*) "Stress can impact your health. What do you usually do to manage stress?" ^nextProposal

proposal: "Do you have any family history of illnesses or medical conditions?"
  u1:(_*) "Thank you for sharing. Are there any specific conditions that run in your family?" ^nextProposal

# Farewell
proposal: "Thank you for sharing all this information with me. I’ll make sure to keep it in mind for your care. If you have any more questions or need further assistance, feel free to ask!"
  u1:(~bye) "Take care, $Name! I’m here if you need anything else."